are only available on Nebula,

00:44:39.750 --> 00:44:42.370
is because they just wouldn't
work here on YouTube.

00:44:42.370 --> 00:44:43.210
They'd never be viewed

00:44:43.210 --> 00:44:44.890
because of the way that the site works.

00:44:44.890 --> 00:44:45.723
But on the other hand,

